===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|stuffen|t=to equip, furnish}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|estoffer}}, {{m|fro|estofer|t=to provide what is necessary, equip, stuff}}, borrowed from {{der|en|goh|stoffōn}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*stoppōn|t=to clog up, block, fill}}. More at {{m|en|stop}}.

====Verb====
